{
    "name": "com.lask3802.unaudio",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "displayName": "UNAudio - Low-Latency Native Audio",
    "description": "Low-latency native audio engine for Unity. Plays Ogg Vorbis / WAV straight from AssetBundles (zero managed copy) with native async decoding, sample-exact scheduling and a smoothed audible-time clock. Backends: WASAPI, CoreAudio, AAudio/OpenSL ES (Oboe), ALSA.",
